        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://familydestinationsguide.com/illinois-tranquil-town-escape/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Downtown Mount Carroll features a rainbow of historic storefronts, each with ornate cornices and weathered brick that tell a century‑old story.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://familydestinationsguide.com/illinois-tranquil-town-escape/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Carroll County Historical Society, established in 1964, preserves local history in six historic buildings that hold artifacts from Carroll County and beyond.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
